# Security Rules

Never expose WooCommerce API keys to the browser.

Secrets must only be used server-side.

Use environment variables:
- NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
- NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
- SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
- WOOCOMMERCE_CONSUMER_KEY
- WOOCOMMERCE_CONSUMER_SECRET
- WOOCOMMERCE_STORE_URL

Use Supabase Row Level Security.

Users should only access data they are allowed to access.

Do not trust client input.
Validate all server actions and API routes with Zod.

Do not log secrets.
Do not return raw server errors to the frontend.